						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#877">SotR changed to DoA</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							Since we set up this space at guildsay while we were in SotR and all but two of us defected-- and the rest had registered already, I asked the owner of guildsay if he could change the name here from SotR to DoA, and he did! Whee!<br />
Thanks Heffling!<br />
<br />
<br />
While it isn't mandatory to submit your chars (as yet) to this database, we hope you do it anyway as until we can get our website up, this is our home away from home! If you want to add your character here remember the password is now: 'doa'<br />
<br />
Events and things and such should go into the appropriate section. A list of guild officers is on the messageboard. <br />
<br />
Cya all in EQ!<br />
<br />
Varen
