						<td class="body">
							Hi all!<br />
<br />
We apologise for changing guild registrar on you, but felt this was a better, easier service.<br />
<br />
All sisters are required to please create an account and register their mains (and alternates, if applicable,) here. <br />
<br />
NOTE: Once that is done, simply click on the server, (in our Case, Ayonae Ro), then click on 'create character' in the upper right hand corner. You can then create your character.<br />
<br />
To set SOTR as your guild, you'll need the guild password when prompted for it, the password is: sotr<br />
<br />
Thanks!<br />
<br />
-Varen
